stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Detected: 偏差识别<br/>(大于阈值或规则触发)
  Detected --> Inbox: 生成偏差事件<br/>进入偏差收件箱

  Inbox --> Triaged: 老师傅/班组认领<br/>判定：正常/异常/未知
  Triaged --> Whitelisted: 判定为正常波动<br/>加入白名单
  Triaged --> NeedTask: 判定需纠偏
  Triaged --> Unknown: 未知新物种

  NeedTask --> TaskOpen: 任务单已创建
  TaskOpen --> TaskDoing: 执行中
  TaskDoing --> TaskOpen: 方案不对<br/>重新派单
  TaskDoing --> TaskDone: 执行完成
  TaskDone --> KnowledgeUpdate: 复盘沉淀
  
  TaskOpen --> Escalated: 超时未处理
  Escalated --> TaskOpen: 厂长确认后<br/>重新分配

  Unknown --> KnowledgeDraft: 老师傅补充语义
  KnowledgeDraft --> KnowledgeUpdate: 审核通过
  KnowledgeDraft --> Unknown: 信息不足<br/>继续观察

  KnowledgeUpdate --> Closed: 事件关闭
  Whitelisted --> Closed: 自动关闭<br/>(记录但不升级)
  Closed --> [*]
